---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="A Guide to Khao Sok Village"
  description="Explore Khao Sok village, the gateway to Khao Sok national park. Discover guesthouses, resorts, restaurants, & shops in this charming hamlet."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Khao-Sok-village-9.jpg"
  heroTitle="A Guide to Khao Sok Village"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Guide To Khao Sok Village", "href": "/guide-to-khao-sok-village/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The real name for this jungle hamlet is Klong Sok but travelers know it as Khao Sok village. It gets its name from the Sok River running through it. You will find Khao Sok village just outside the gates to the Khao Sok national park in Southern Thailand.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The village, just a short walk from the park entrance, serves as the main base from which to venture into the park. Many guesthouses, resorts, and hostels cater to the park visitors. Among these are tasty restaurants, relaxing cafes and useful shops.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How to get to Khao Sok village?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The village sits on route 401, just 36 kilometers from the west coast town of Takua Pa. This road runs all the way across the Thailand peninsula to Surat Thani on the East coast. You will find many modes of transport from public buses to minivans and even private transport. <a href="/khao-sok-map-directions/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Find all the transportation information you need here</a>.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Khao-Sok-village-9.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Village - National Park gates"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Village - National Park gates</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What’s in Khao Sok village?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Well for one thing you won’t be short of eating opportunities. Many choices exist, ranging from the cheapest roadside café to Italian restaurants and pizza cafes.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Just across the bridge you will find an excellent pizza place. As you walk around the village, you will see many resort entrances. Most of these resorts have restaurants that are open to everyone.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Plenty of shops are available whether you need a new sim card or a drinking bottle for your hike.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Khao-Sok-village-1.jpg"
            alt="Eating in khao Sok Village"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Eating in khao Sok Village</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Getting around</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can walk to most places in Khao Sok village. Many chances to explore the area around it also exist.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Many people take the opportunity to enjoy the scenery by bicycle. Loads of places exist to rent a bike. Many resorts offer them as a service.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Back down the road to route the 401 you will find a motorbike rental place. The Honda and Suzuki scooters are a great way to explore the village and its surroundings.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          A popular and easy trip is to the Khao Sok <a href="/what-to-do-in-khao-sok-a-drivers-guide/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">viewpoint</a> just a few kilometers away.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Most resorts, hostels and guesthouses will arrange a motorbike for you. As with anywhere you should take great care driving as some of the roads are a bit narrow. Please remember to always <a href="http://driving-in-thailand.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">drive on the LEFT in Thailand</a>!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          If you don’t like driving or riding, you can use the many minibuses and trucks. They take travelers to and from the activities and attractions in the village and nearby areas.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-5.jpg"
            alt="Riding a bike in Khao Sok"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Riding a bike in Khao Sok</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-6.jpg"
            alt="Rent a bike"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Rent a bike</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/packages-call-to-action.jpg"
            alt="Enjoying Khao Sok lake"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Enjoying Khao Sok lake</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For the best way<br /> to experience<br /> the wonders of Khao Sok
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Please visit our packages page.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Things to do at Khao Sok Village</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Indeed, there are many activities available within just a short ride from the village. How about trying your hand at <a href="/khao-sok-jungle-cooking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">jungle cooking</a>? This is a surprisingly enjoyable experience even if you are not that interested in cooking. You will learn a lot about local plants, vegetables, fruits, and the herbs and spices in Thai dishes.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Not far away is <a href="/khao-sok-elephant-sanctuary/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Sonchana Kao Sok elephant sanctuary</a>. Here you can have an amazing up close and personal time with <a href="/asian-elephant-khao-sok-national-park-elephant/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Thai elephants</a> that have retired from working life. You might be lucky enough to come across wild elephants in the park, but this is a wonderful chance to truly meet them.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You won’t find parades, shows and elephant tricks performed for the entertainment of tourists here. No one rides on them either.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Instead you can help prepare their meals and feed them. You will learn so much about these gentle giants here and at the end of the day why not take a refreshing bath with them in the river. You will find this is a truly fabulous experience!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Many resorts offer short <a href="/khao-sok-night-safari/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">night safaris</a> in the surrounding forests. At Khao Sok village you are never more than a short walk to the forests and jungles and they are teaming with wildlife. Much of it only comes out at night. With a head torch and an experienced guide, you will be amazed by the many sights and sounds you will see.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-7.jpg"
            alt="Thai Cooking class"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Thai Cooking class</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village13.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok village elephants"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok village elephants</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village11.jpg"
            alt="Jungle safari"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Jungle safari</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok national park</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Of course, the main attraction is the vast and exciting national park. Many people include an overnight stay on the <a href="/khao-sok-floating-bungalows/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">floating bamboo huts</a>. The boat rides across the <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Lan Lake</a> will take you through incredible Karst scenery.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Amazing views await at every turn of your head. Venturing further you can trek and hike for miles through forests along jungle trails. However, you don’t have to enter the park and pay the entrance fee to enjoy a good hike.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Many trails lead out from the village. Any resort or restaurant will be able to point you in the right direction. Unlike in the park you won’t need a guide on these trails and you are free to wander and discover the area on your own.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village10.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok national park"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok national park</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>The River Sok</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The river offers relaxing views and gentle river sounds but also provides loads of fun things to do. Go swimming in the fresh water fed by the surrounding mountains.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Take a canoe trip through plantations, farms and forests. Keep an eye out for monkeys lazing in the branches and snakes, birds and other wildlife that make the river banks their home. The village is the gateway to the national park.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The river actually rises in mountains to the west of Khao Sok and does not come from the park. It then flows east along route 401. At Ko Pak Ruap it joins the River Phun Duang which runs all the way to Surat Thani.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          In Khao Sok village it is the backdrop to many resort balconies, restaurants and cafes. Most significantly it is your pathway to an amazing ride through the forests and jungles.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can take a canoe trip from the bridge in the middle of the village. Leave the village and gently float through the grounds of several resorts. You will even go as far as Riverside Cottages and a bit beyond.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          When there is enough water in the river you can also enjoy tubing down the river. Jump on an inflated rubber tube and gently rock and roll down the stream. A great adventure for all the family and all ages except for the youngest.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-3.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok national park"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok national park</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-8.jpg"
            alt="Sok river"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Sok river</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>In conclusion</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Most people visit Khao Sok village because they want to enjoy the national park. However, many people feel surprised by how much fun they can have without entering the park. Such a great atmosphere with so many places to relax and enjoy swapping tales with fellow travellers.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Add in the fun adventures on the river and nearby attractions. You will remember your visit for more than just the park.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <a href="/finding-perfect-khao-sok-bungalow/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Riverside Cottages</a> is a short ride down the river from the village center. It offers a unique place to stay that connects with the nearby forests and nature.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We also offer many transport options to take you to the village and other attractions when you need to go.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Whether you are looking for a day tour, a private tour, or a lake tour that includes a visit to a raft house we can assist you.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We look forward to welcoming you and have all you need at the best value to make the most of your Khao Sok visit. Check out our <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">packages</a> page for more details or contact us for more information.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Check out our <a href="/khao-sok-faqs/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">FAQs</a> and <a href="/khao-sok-blog/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Blog</a> for more information about Khao Sok and the National Park.
        </p>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
